<title>USA: Study shows Tecnol cervical brace effective.</title>
<headline>Study shows Tecnol cervical brace effective.</headline>
<dateline>FORT WORTH 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tecnol Medical Products Inc said Wednesday that a study conducted at Drexel University in Philadelphia showed the Tecnol 911 cervical brace is effective in limiting the motion of the neck.</p>
</text>
